This license covers the code only. The data and imagery in this repository
keep their own licenses and are not covered by the MIT License:

- app/public/tiles/: satellite imagery from Sentinel-2 cloudless by EOX
  (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) and ground, building, tree and road data from Flood Check.
- app/public/past/: past floods from Google Groundsource (CC BY 4.0) and past
  forecasts from the ECMWF IFS ensemble archive at dynamical.org (CC BY 4.0).
- app/public/normals/: normal rain computed from CHIRPS (Climate Hazards
  Center, UC Santa Barbara).
- design/: photos credited in the mockups keep the licenses named with them.
- evals/: speech clips and transcripts from Google FLEURS (CC BY 4.0).

See the "Data and credits" section of README.md for each source.
